WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:00.640
In the first chapter of <i>Kokoro</i>, the romance with the young lady, the friendship with K,

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:05.350
<b>Host
Sakai Masato</b>

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.020
the betrayal and the suicide

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:07.320
were opened up through the eyes of Teacher.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.440
Teacher

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.700
In the second chapter, this story will be retold through the eyes of K.

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.910
A view which was not present in the original work.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:19.450
Just how did the two look in the eyes of K?

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.500
And why did K choose suicide?

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.790
Suicide
And why did K choose suicide?

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:24.210
Suicide

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:24.620
The masterpieces are blue.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.420
The
masterpieces
are blue

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.000
Please watch the final episode of <i>Kokoro</i>.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.950
Madam, this is K, the man who I told you about the other day.

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:04.790
Pleased to meet you.

00:01:15.050 --> 00:01:19.470
She was like a sunflower.

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:20.510
Kokoro

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:24.270
Winter
Kokoro

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.180
Hey...

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.520
Can't you be more friendly?

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:31.230
There's a small anteroom here.

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:33.150
You can either use my room or...

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:35.740
Here is fine.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:36.900
Excuse me.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:38.320
Yes?

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:43.120
Oh my, K chose that room?

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:44.330
So it seems.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:51.500
That room is small, but it's connected to the yard, right Teacher?

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:53.380
Teacher?

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:57.220
Yeah, she calls me that as a joke.

00:01:57.220 --> 00:02:01.680
It's no joke, you're always reading books.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:05.600
By your standards, anyone could be a teacher.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.180
That was mean!

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:13.900
Oh yes, K.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.860
Isn't that room cold?

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:18.490
We have an unused brazier, but it's old.

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.570
I'm fine.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:24.580
We can warm ourselves here at the fire before you get into your futon.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.290
No thanks.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.210
Why not?

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:29.830
Aren't you cold?

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.460
Even so, I don't need it.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:36.010
What a strange man.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.390
I love playing the koto.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:43.600
It seems effort is separate from talent.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:44.970
Then what about heredity?

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:47.060
You didn't have to say that!

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.810
I know that from my dad.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:54.940
Are all women so noisy?

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.930
Studying?

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.520
I made some amazake.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.690
Want to have some together?

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:18.860
No thanks.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.950
You're always like that.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.580
It's torn.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:37.750
Take it off.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:38.750
Leave it alone.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.630
Hey, stop that!

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:44.720
Are you embarrassed?

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:48.970
Not at all!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:50.850
Then take it off.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:52.890
There's no need!

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:56.560
S... S... S...

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.650
I'm home.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:03.820
Madam?

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.000
Are you here?

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.260
I'm confused.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.390
Is she making fun of me?

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.810
Why does she care about me?

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.640
You've been going home early lately.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.800
Classes are boring.

00:06:13.510 --> 00:06:15.890
How is it living together with her?

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:17.890
Those women aren't that bad, right?

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:19.770
But...

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.400
But what?

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:26.070
I don't get what those women are thinking.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.360
What do you mean?

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:31.410
It doesn't seem like they're trying to learn anything.

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:35.790
That's because men and women learn different things.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:36.910
Same thing.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:40.540
Those who don't want to improve themselves mentally are fools.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.920
Once you lose your humanity, you're done for.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.710
Are you saying I'm not human?

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.260
I didn't say that.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.930
Actually, you're quite the human.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.930
You're making a fool of me, aren't you?

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.890
Throwing your words around.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:57.680
Pretending to be training.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.850
Now now.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.190
You're emotional as hell today.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.570
You're not in love with her, are you?

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:05.570
What are you saying?

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:07.360
You are, right?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.570
You love her...

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:13.950
Isn't it obvious?

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.040
Women get in the way of training.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.250
Indeed they do.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.230
K!

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.320
Your hand is cold.

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:52.990
Let's go home together.

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:15.640
Did he see us?

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:51.590
Sorry about this.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:54.800
Yeah...

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:57.910
Why are you doing this?

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.320
Did he ask you to?

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.490
He did.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.160
But he didn't tell me to go this far.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:32.230
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.280
Take me away from here.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.360
Why?!

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:44.200
I don't want to be stuck here forever.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:44.990
I can't.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:46.160
Coward.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.790
How could I possibly do that?

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:50.370
Hey.

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.170
K, did something happen?

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:56.300
No, nothing.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.260
I see.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:10:59.970
Okay then.

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:01.470
Good night.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.470
G'night.

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.230
What should I do?

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:20.150
K, are you worried about something?

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:24.780
Tell me.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:28.370
What should I do about these feelings?

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:30.910
Save me.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:36.250
I love her!

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:38.800
I beg of you.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:40.220
Say something!

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:45.720
Do you despise me?

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:55.770
Please!

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.820
Run away with me.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.610
What's wrong with you?

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:01.820
My mother...

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:05.990
My mother accepted a proposal without asking me.

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.160
We're out of time!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.290
But...

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:11.500
Please!

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.330
Live with me!

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.570
What do you want?

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:49.530
I'm studying.

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:52.160
Please, spare me some time.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.000
Tell me...

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.800
I bet you know already.

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.720
I'm asking you for advice.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.050
What should I do?

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:10.890
Are you asking whether to advance or retreat?

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:15.060
Would you be able to retreat even if you decided to?

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:20.770
Aren't those who don't want to
improve themselves mentally fools?

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.650
No, I'm the fool.

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.490
Let's drop this.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:26.240
Forget about it.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.200
How selfish.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.910
You're the one who brought it up.

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:34.370
Besides, you can't really forget what you want to forget.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.040
Unless you have the determination to do so.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.630
Determination?

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.840
I do have some.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.060
Tomorrow.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:05.610
Tomorrow morning, you'll leave home as usual.

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:07.700
I'll be waiting at the station.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:30.260
Did you catch a cold?

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.060
I don't know.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.930
You should rest today.

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:39.100
Please let me do so.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:42.230
I might come home late today.

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:43.570
Did something happen?

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.400
No, nothing special.

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:49.280
I'll get going.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.200
Okay.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.370
Have a good day.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.670
How are you today?

00:15:08.670 --> 00:15:10.430
I'm sorry, Miss.

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.300
Oh my.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.810
You have a large bag today.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:21.350
Studying must be tough.

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:24.400
Madam, there's no need to make me dinner tonight.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:25.770
Training again?

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:27.780
I have things to do.

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:29.400
I see.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.450
By the way.

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.660
What are you planning to do after you graduate in spring?

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.040
I haven't decided yet.

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.960
Actually, about this house...

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.460
It's hard for me to say this, but...

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:49.260
I think that from now on,
you should be looking for a new place.

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:55.760
You wouldn't want to live with newlyweds, right?

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.220
What's this about?

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.850
I know you're friends and all, but still...

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:03.020
I think you should take them into consideration too.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.770
Friends, huh.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:09.360
So, when my daughter gets married,

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.780
please leave this house.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:12.450
Married?

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:15.030
Oh no, you didn't know?

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:18.240
I wonder why he hid it from you.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.040
And you all get along so well.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.040
They must both be embarrassed.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.500
Please be glad for them too.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.210
When's the wedding?

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.170
We haven't decided on the date yet,

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:33.840
but I guess it'll be soon after they graduate.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:36.300
I'd like to present them a gift,

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.640
but I can't since I have no money.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:48.190
Was she lying to me?

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:51.320
Did they both betray me?

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.070
What's the meaning of this?

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.880
Aren't you sick?

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:10.840
Yes.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.800
Shouldn't you go to a doctor?

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:15.050
You can afford it.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.050
I already feel better.

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.390
I'm going this way.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:25.140
I see.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:27.150
You have things to do today, right?

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:32.440
By the way, she told me the same thing.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.650
That she has things to do?

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:34.690
Yeah.

00:17:34.690 --> 00:17:36.150
I wonder what kind of things.

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:39.990
Is he making a fool of me?

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.910
Why is he saying it like that?

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:48.290
Did she make fun of me by
promising to run away together?

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.500
Are you all right?

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.590
You look pale.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:58.720
She loves you!

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.600
Hey, K.

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.640
Well then.

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:09.900
The first snow.

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:16.170
There's no doubt that I might've been dead by now

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:20.970
if it hadn't been for you.

00:19:23.640 --> 00:19:28.100
A guy like you who has everything...

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:33.650
Could never imagine that people have things they can't give up...

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:38.030
She's mine!

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:03.510
Miss...

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:17.860
Thank you.

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:32.120
For smiling and giving me warmth.

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:33.960
Miss...

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.170
I'm grateful to you.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:39.730
<b>Winter this
year was warm</b>

00:22:55.010 --> 00:23:00.020
Part One
Next Time
Run, Melos!
